<style>
  .community-header {
    font-size: 37px;
    max-width: 753px;
    line-height: 44px;
    padding-bottom: 100px;
  }
  .community-grid {
    max-width: 100%;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    grid-template-rows: min-content;
    column-gap: 20px;
    row-gap: 92px;
  }
  .community-cell {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: top;
    grid-column: span 1;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .community-cell .number {
    font-size: 16px;
    padding: 0 0 10px 0;
  }
  .community-cell img {
    display: block; 
    width: 100%;
  }
  .community-cell p {
    display: block;
    text-align: left;
    font-size: 14px;
    padding: 4px 0 10px 0;
    max-width: 320px;
    line-height: 19px;
    min-height: 100px;
  }
  .community-cell a {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .community-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(1, 1fr);
      grid-template-rows: min-content;
    }
    .community-header {
        font-size: 27px;
        max-width: 753px;
        line-height: 33px;
        padding-bottom: 100px;
    }
  }
  
</style>

{% include "loading" %}

<div class="page-padding">

  <h1 class="page-title">Community Appreciation 02</h1>

  <div class="community-header">
    A collection of images of how people wear and interact with Adsum out in the world, and a tribute to the people who support us.
  </div>
  
  <div class="community-grid">
    <div class=community-cell>
      <div class="number">1</div>
      <p>
        Not even brownie in his teeth can ruin <a href="https://www.instagram.com/olivershaw/" target="_blank">@olivershaw</a>'s beautiful mug. Our FW21 beanie doesn't hurt either. Thanks for catching this moment <a href="https://www.instagram.com/sammiepurulak/" target="_blank">@sammiepurulak</a>.
      </p>
      <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0664/2387/files/aIMG_8036.jpg?v=1673470753">
    </div>
    <div class=community-cell>
      <div class="number">2</div>
      <p>
        <a href="https://www.instagram.com/bea.evans" target="_blank">@bea.evans</a> somehow found a dead ringer color match pant to pair with our <a href="/products/ls-pocket-tee-royal-blue-1" target="_blank">Royal Blue Longsleeve Pocket Tee</a>. 
      </p>
      <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0664/2387/files/aIMG_7717.jpg?v=1673471904">
    </div>
    <div class=community-cell>
      <div class="number">3</div>
      <p>
        <a href="https://www.instagram.com/oldmanalan" target="_blank">@oldmanalan</a> recently took the team-favorite <a href="/products/cutter-jacket-black" target="_blank">Cutter Jacket</a> out on a beautiful but cold day. 
      </p>
      <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0664/2387/files/aasIMG_BC7AED186381-1.jpg?v=1673473335">
    </div>
    <div class=community-cell>
      <div class="number">4</div>
