      </p>  
      <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0664/2387/files/ddIMG_7559.jpg?v=1673541828">    
    </div>
    <div class=community-cell>
      <div class="number">6</div>
      <p>
       <a href="https://www.instagram.com/mariaulvw" target="_blank">@mariaulvw</a> got in touch with the Norwegian outdoors in FW21's <a href="https://www.eastandwest.store/adsum/classic-logo-tee-in-ash-heather-ym4hw" target="_blank">Freeport Tee</a>.
      </p>
      <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0664/2387/files/qewdwq313908312_512083883905289_2754043327403195241_n.jpg?v=1673636278">
    </div>
