      </p>
      <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0664/2387/files/aaaunnamed-1.jpg?v=1673623823">
    </div>
    <div class=community-cell>
      <div class="number">9</div>
      <p>
        <a href="https://www.instagram.com/earth.death/" target="_blank">@earth.death</a> snapped a photo of <a href="https://www.instagram.com/laytonmiles__/" target="_blank">@laytonmiles__</a> taking a photo of her while wearing an FW21 Classic Plaid Workshirt. 
      </p>
      <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0664/2387/files/kjbnADEC4E7A-678E-4038-96AD-24A63CF5E157.jpg?v=1673641351">
